    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is significantly above recent 10-day average, reduce by 5–10% to align with historical volatility patterns.",
    "For 30-day forecasts, penalize over-optimistic highs (especially > +15% above recent peak) — sentiment +0.50 often signals short-term correction.",
    "If sentiment is neutral (0.00) and price is trending downward, slightly increase downward bias to avoid false optimism."
